# The Holy Crest (sandoria 93): Morjean's 65 reads no status. Accepted (GM) with TheHolyCrest_Event 2 (GM): his
# default 601, then 65; its finish begins the quest again (player:addQuest on an accepted quest) and sets the var 3.
# Completed (GM) with the var 2 (GM): 601, then 65; its finish adds the quest again and sets the var 3.
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=100.1,0,114.1 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Sandoria.TheHolyCrest accepted
charvar TheHolyCrest_Event 2
login
trigger Morjean                           # default 601
finish
trigger Morjean                           # accepted, TheHolyCrest_Event 2: 65 (no status read)
finish                                    # addQuest again; TheHolyCrest_Event 3
quest Sandoria.TheHolyCrest completed     # GM
charvar TheHolyCrest_Event 2              # GM
trigger Morjean                           # default 601
finish
trigger Morjean                           # completed, TheHolyCrest_Event 2: 65 (no status read)
finish                                    # addQuest on a completed quest; TheHolyCrest_Event 3
